        "TileImage": "$($repository 5670fc1a-a808-4a6e-9e41-c915d2fdcad3).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Today you will complete the first in a series of missions designed to test your skills with a sniper rifle. Eliminate your targets without being spotted and without killing anyone else. Don&apos;t worry about your moral culpability for killing the targets, as they have all done very bad things, we promise. We leave you to prepare. As always, good luck.",
